# Task 1 Report — Pure Strategy-Policy Boundary

Status: DONE

Commit: `7a59244 feat: define pure strategy policy boundary`

## What changed

- Added the closed `core.strategy_policy` package with policy interface version 1, a typed client protocol/factory, frozen slot-based primitive contracts, canonical JSON serialization, and trusted output validators.
- Added baseline pure entry, capacity, allocation, eviction, and exit policies. They preserve the fixed CANSLIM gates, uncapped capacity behavior, configured sizing inputs, two-pass eviction selection, tiered exits, early-winner behavior, stop ratchets, and EMA/time-stop ordering.
- Added focused behavioral tests for every snapshot/decision contract, JSON round trips, closed schema validation, immutable collections, finite strict scalars, enum validation, policy behavior, and exit-plan validation.

